{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ！！\n広島行ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーでは初の広島！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんまあやの出身地、広島ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は真夏と\n影アナやらせてもらいました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCもいろいろやりましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型も全国ツアー中\nずっと一緒だったのに\n今日だけ変えてみたり\\( ･ω･)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー初だったのに\nこんなに盛り上がるライブになって\n本当に嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中が広島ホームテレビさんにて\n放送開始される、という\nサプライズ発表がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2週遅れとなると、中田の回なんですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非とも見ていただきたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島のみなさん\n乃木坂46の事、より一層\n応援よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ以外のお話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルは生駒ちゃんと一緒でした＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の1公演目のライブに\n来てくださってた方は気になるかもしれないですけど\n噂の抱き枕 広島にもいましたね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、定番のご当地グルメレポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、定番の\n生もみじまんじゅう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お土産にもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く食べたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて\n日本では広島発祥の\nバームクーヘン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n今日のお昼ご飯は\nあとむのお好み焼き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ美味しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかわりしちゃいましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝ごはんは\nむさしの俵むすび でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5種類入っててどれがどの味かわからなかったから\n梅が苦手な中田的には\n正直ロシアンルーレットだったんだけど\n食べてみたらまさかの梅でした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、これが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田、梅を克服してしまったようです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りに\nカスターニャの廣島カタラーナを買って\n食べて帰りました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごちそうさまでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー\n広島本当に楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/16/3615841/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのＣＭを見れなかった事だけが\n心残りです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}